(7126248, 1089614, 124982, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, Pip...hope it''s doing well! Love the processing!</td>', 'Awesome shot, Pip...hope it''s doing well! Love the processing!', '2013-11-06 18:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7126249, 1089677, 124982, '<td valign="top">Robt, I am very fond of self-portraits, and think this one is staggeringly good! Superb lighting, and always, you''ve processed this like a champ. Just don''t connect as a viewer with any real sense of fear for your phobia though. It''s not that i don''t have your fear (for obvious reasons), but it''s not conveyed well. If I didn''t know the challenge, I could easily look at this image and see a man deep in thought, not a man with a sever fear of something. Sorry for the diatribe, Bear....not intentional. Anyway, undoubtedly I''ll see this on the front page, stellar shot. I''m jealous! 9.</td>', 'Robt, I am very fond of self-portraits, and think this one is staggeringly good! Superb lighting, and always, you''ve processed this like a champ. Just don''t connect as a viewer with any real sense of fear for your phobia though. It''s not that i don''t have your fear (for obvious reasons), but it''s not conveyed well. If I didn''t know the challenge, I could easily look at this image and see a man deep in thought, not a man with a sever fear of something. Sorry for the diatribe, Bear....not intentional. Anyway, undoubtedly I''ll see this on the front page, stellar shot. I''m jealous! 9.', '2013-11-06 18:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
