(7126974, 1089238, 30861, '<td valign="top">I want the jacket: you can send it to me with the knife, OK? Keep the gun, I don''t need it. As for fears saving me, I have it on good authority that Corys are characterized by acute Ursaphobia, so I''m not worried. Anyway, that thing can''t bring down a full-grown Kodiak, which is what I am...</td>', 'I want the jacket: you can send it to me with the knife, OK? Keep the gun, I don''t need it. As for fears saving me, I have it on good authority that Corys are characterized by acute Ursaphobia, so I''m not worried. Anyway, that thing can''t bring down a full-grown Kodiak, which is what I am...', '2013-11-07 21:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
