(7127145, 1089264, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very well done, all in all, though I didn''t take from it so much a sense of claustrophobia as some other, non-specific, madness. Probably because I don''t think of claustrophobia in white spaces, though I''m sure that''s a limitation of my perception rather than of your depiction :-) In any case, a haunting image and congrats!</td>', 'Very well done, all in all, though I didn''t take from it so much a sense of claustrophobia as some other, non-specific, madness. Probably because I don''t think of claustrophobia in white spaces, though I''m sure that''s a limitation of my perception rather than of your depiction :-) In any case, a haunting image and congrats!', '2013-11-08 00:14:19.000000', NULL, 0),
