(7127203, 1089787, 113591, '<td valign="top">Being afraid of falling down those small steps is not irrational.<br/>Believing that the snake will appear from under the leaves is not irrational.<br/>Seeing that the steps suddenly leads into a black hole is not irrational.<br/>Expecting the bent trees to fall on one is not irrational.<br/>Fearing falling into the hole off the steps because your foot slipped after jumping into the path of a falling tree because a snake bit you is irrational.<br/> <br/>Thanks, enjoyed it, hehe.<br/> <br/>spelling fixed.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-11-08 06:34:41.</i></td>', 'Being afraid of falling down those small steps is not irrational.Believing that the snake will appear from under the leaves is not irrational.Seeing that the steps suddenly leads into a black hole is not irrational.Expecting the bent trees to fall on one is not irrational.Fearing falling into the hole off the steps because your foot slipped after jumping into the path of a falling tree because a snake bit you is irrational. Thanks, enjoyed it, hehe. spelling fixed.', '2013-11-08 00:50:07.000000', '2013-11-08 06:34:41.000000', 0),
